    Q('mcq', 'What problem can arise from leaving a catalogue field blank?', 'B', 'readers cannot tell whether the information was investigated and remained unknown or was simply never entered', 'A blank does not distinguish investigated uncertainty from missing data entry.', opts=['The object will lose its stable address.', 'Readers may misunderstand why information is absent.', 'The field will automatically receive an estimated date.', 'Specialist terms become impossible to search.']),
